      "id": "claim_d8d79ff76c5a4a97995491baa8ed5372",
      "statement": "The system uses HikariCP to manage two distinct Oracle datasources: a primary datasource (PSP_CONNECTOR_ONECOMM) for general data and a secondary datasource (PSP_CONNECTOR_ONECOMM_PAYMENT2) specifically for payment partition queries, both configured via app.properties.",
